ctr: alternate boot mode, held START or SELECT

With "alt_mode = true" in the manifest, holding START or SELECT while the
game boots shows it pixel perfect (square pixels, integer scale, no
filtering) inside romfs:/bezel_alt.png, or no bezel when there is none.
The configuration is not saved on exit in that mode, so the game's own
settings and bezel stay as they were.

